{
  "name": "Hinkley PMS – Smoobu sync (webhook + hourly)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "hinkley-smoobu-REPLACE-WITH-RANDOM-SECRET",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f0ee3179-d646-471c-a236-5b34d1a22548",
      "name": "Smoobu webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1104,
        816
      ],
      "webhookId": "0c8a1f4e-7d3b-4e5a-9b6c-2d1e3f4a5b6c",
      "notes": "Smoobu doesn't sign its webhooks, so the path carries a secret. Before activating, replace REPLACE-WITH-RANDOM-SECRET with 32+ random characters (node -e \"console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(24).toString('hex'))\"), then paste the production URL into Smoobu: Settings > Advanced > API Keys > Webhook URL. Keep that URL private. Answers Smoobu straight away; the app re-reads each booking from Smoobu, so the payload itself is never trusted."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://hinkleyhomes-property-management.replit.app/api/integrations/smoobu/event",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.body) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "9de9c354-b5a9-47a9-b078-b29259c57d44",
      "name": "Forward event to PMS",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1344,
        816
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "FIwP4Ffez0ckSdW4",
          "name": "Header Auth account 2"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Sends Smoobu's event ({ action, user, data }) to the PMS, which refreshes that booking from Smoobu (or the guest messages count). Header Auth credential: Name = X-Hinkley-Sync-Key, Value = the PMS_SYNC_KEY secret."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "30 */3 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "0f228bc6-0652-4ca9-aa3f-8d329d036e81",
      "name": "Every 3 hours",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1104,
        1040
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://hinkleyhomes-property-management.replit.app/api/integrations/smoobu/sync",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000
        }
      },
      "id": "2c99629e-0cbe-4062-8456-c71c24764194",
      "name": "Catch-up sync",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1344,
        1040
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "FIwP4Ffez0ckSdW4",
          "name": "Header Auth account 2"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Asks the PMS to read the Smoobu apartment list and every booking changed since its last good sync, in case a webhook was missed. Same Header Auth credential as above."
    }
  ],
  "pinData": {},
  "connections": {
    "Smoobu webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Forward event to PMS",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Every 3 hours": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Catch-up sync",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
